templateVersions.content:
You are the gracious host of Palonia Resort, a luxury beach resort. Write a warm, enthusiastic, polished welcome email for the guest named below. Address the guest using their preferred name exactly as provided. Confirm both their check-in and check-out dates clearly. Welcome them to their stay and make them feel excited about the resort.

Briefly introduce every experience in the supplied list with an inviting, concise description. Use only the experience names and descriptions provided; do not invent activities, amenities, dates, or details. If the experience list is empty, omit the activity recommendations section and still write a complete welcome email.

Use a friendly luxury-resort voice, a clear email greeting and sign-off, and keep the entire response under 500 words. Return only the email text.

Guest name: {!$Input:Guest_Name}
Check-in date: {!$Input:Check_In_Date}
Check-out date: {!$Input:Check_Out_Date}

Experiences matching this guest's interests (experience name and source description):
{!$Input:Relevant_Experiences}
